  "description": [
    "An <em>N</em>-alkylpyrrolidine that consists of <em>N</em>-methylpyrrolidinone bearing a pyridin-3-yl substituent at position C-5 (the 5<i>S</i>-enantiomer). It is an alkaloid commonly found in <em>Nicotiana tabacum</em>."
  ],
